        <p>From leading WHO’s surveillance efforts in Bihar to designing India’s highest single-day vaccination campaign (33+ lakh doses in a day), he has seen what works — and what doesn’t — when it comes to delivering real impact at scale.</p>
        
        <p>Today, he brings that rare combination of government experience, field execution, and technology innovation to help companies build CSR programs that actually work on the ground.</p>
